@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> Off

state Activated
Activated : entry / Set alarm time
Activated : do / Ring alarm when current time matches set alarm time
Activated : exit / Stop alarm

Off --> Activated : user sets alarm time

Activated --> OnAlarm : current time matches set alarm time

state OnAlarm
OnAlarm : entry / Ring alarm
OnAlarm : do / Allow user to stop alarm
OnAlarm : exit / Return to activated state

Activated --> OnAlarm : alarm ringing

OnAlarm --> Off : user stops alarm

Off --> [*]

@enduml
